---
title: "debt_value_calculation - Weighted Debt Value (Scallop Lend)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: debt_value = 0
    q_init --> q_iter: for each debt asset in obligation
    q_iter --> q_get_price: fetch price_i from x_oracle
    q_get_price --> q_get_weight: get borrow_weight_i for asset type
    q_get_weight --> q_calc: weighted_debt_i = amount_i * price_i * borrow_weight_i
    q_calc --> q_accumulate: debt_value += weighted_debt_i
    q_accumulate --> q_iter: next debt asset
    q_accumulate --> [*]: return debt_value

    note right of q_calc
        INV-001: borrow_weight_i >= 1.0 (volatile assets have higher weight)
        INV-002: debt_value = sum(amount_i * price_i * borrow_weight_i)
        INV-003: higher borrow_weight means less can be borrowed for volatile assets
        INV-004: USDC borrow_weight = 1.0, SUI borrow_weight = 1.25
    end note
